              "newText": "thereof (a \"Dispute\") that is not resolved within [***] after written notice of the Dispute by one Party to the other shall be brought exclusively in the state and federal courts located in New York County, New York, and each Party irrevocably submits to the exclusive jurisdiction of such courts over the merits of any Dispute."
            },
